  "description": "Retells Clarice Lispector’s The Hour of the Star through Rodrigo S. M.’s struggle to narrate Macabéa, a poor migrant typist in Rio de Janeiro. Follows her relationship with Olímpico, Glória’s assistance, the fortune-teller’s promise and its fatal reversal, while questioning the narrator’s authority to represent her life.",
